      "description": "A religious movement that claims descent from the ancient Israelites and often identifies as the true descendants of the biblical Israelites. This group is distinct from mainstream Judaism and has been subject to criticism and misunderstanding. The meme falsely equates Black people with Hebrew Israelites, implying a shared identity that is historically inaccurate and rooted in antisemitic tropes.",
