      "description": "The text 'we were known as hebrew israelites' is overlaid on the image of the group of Black men, creating an analogical mapping where the visual group is being identified as 'Hebrew Israelites' in the context of their historical identity prior to slavery. This mapping is part of a hateful and historically inaccurate claim that falsely equates Black people with Hebrew Israelites, rooted in antisemitic tropes.",
