      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_1562f122",
      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the group of Black men as 'Hebrew Israelites'",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the group of Black men, who are being framed by the text as 'Hebrew Israelites' before slavery. This projection implies the user identifies with or is meant to identify with this group in the context of the meme's hateful narrative, which falsely equates them with Hebrew Israelites and erases their distinct African American identity. The projection is implicit, not explicit with deictic pronouns, but the entire meme structure directs the user's identification onto the visual group as the subject of the historical claim.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
